bsite%20news-%20Family%20night.png" alt="Article" width="316" height="313" loading="lazy"/>	</div>	<div class="contentWrap">	<div class="title heading-h3">College invites families to celebrate the season at Family Night in Douglas</div>	<div class="text regular-text">Celebrate Family Night at Cochise College in Douglas on Dec. 2! Join in free holiday crafts, photos with Mr. and Mrs. Claus, posole and folklórico dancing....</div>	</div></a></div>
